ent-MedicalTrackingTablet = medical rescue tablet
    .desc = Shows clients' last known body positions and condition on the bluespace map. { medical-tracking-visibility } Requires medical access.
ent-MedicalTrackingPinpointer = platinum client pinpointer
    .desc = Selects and tracks a registered platinum or ruby client's brain, even after extraction or destruction of the body. { medical-tracking-visibility } Requires medical access.
ent-MedicalTrackingImplantBasic = basic medical tracking implant
    .desc = Reports the client's death to the medical channel within Colossus territory only.
ent-MedicalTrackingImplantSilver = silver medical tracking implant
    .desc = Reports critical condition and death throughout the sector to the medical channel.
ent-MedicalTrackingImplantGold = gold medical tracking implant
    .desc = Includes silver coverage and reports the body's position and condition to medical tablets every 5 seconds. { medical-tracking-visibility } The marker disappears when the body is destroyed.
ent-MedicalTrackingImplantPlatinum = platinum medical tracking implant
    .desc = Includes gold coverage and registers the client's brain for tracking, even after extraction or destruction of the body. { medical-tracking-visibility }
ent-MedicalTrackingImplanterBasic = basic medical tracking implanter
    .desc = { ent-MedicalTrackingImplantBasic.desc } Higher tiers replace the previous medical implant.
ent-MedicalTrackingImplanterSilver = silver medical tracking implanter
    .desc = { ent-MedicalTrackingImplantSilver.desc } Higher tiers replace the previous medical implant.
ent-MedicalTrackingImplanterGold = gold medical tracking implanter
    .desc = { ent-MedicalTrackingImplantGold.desc } Higher tiers replace the previous medical implant.
ent-MedicalTrackingImplanterPlatinum = platinum medical tracking implanter
    .desc = { ent-MedicalTrackingImplantPlatinum.desc } Higher tiers replace the previous medical implant.
ent-MedicalTrackingImplantRuby = ruby medical tracking implant
    .desc = Platinum medical coverage with a distinctive ruby insignia. Tracks the body and brain and reports critical condition and death. { medical-tracking-visibility }
ent-MedicalTrackingImplanterRuby = ruby medical tracking implanter
    .desc = { ent-MedicalTrackingImplantRuby.desc } Replaces a lower-tier medical implant.
